sequenceDiagram
    participant Partner as Partner app
    participant API as Express API
    participant Store as Object store
    participant Queue as Redis queue
    participant Worker as Resize worker
    participant WS as ws channel

    Partner->>API: POST /uploads (JWT bearer, multipart image)
    API->>API: zod schema validation (content-type, size)
    API->>Store: put original (UUID key)
    API->>Queue: enqueue resize job
    API-->>Partner: 202 Accepted (upload id)

    Note over Queue,Worker: Async — returns immediately above

    Queue->>Worker: dequeue resize job
    Worker->>Worker: sharp: generate 128px / 512px / 1024px variants
    Worker->>Store: put each thumbnail variant
    Worker->>Partner: axios POST signed webhook (HMAC-signed payload)
    Worker->>WS: push status event
    WS-->>Partner: live processing status (if subscribed)

    alt webhook delivery fails
        Worker->>Partner: retry with exponential backoff (up to 5 attempts)
        Worker->>Worker: after 5th failure, move job to dead-letter queue
    end
